Package: flashpack
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adb | android-tools-adb, fastboot | android-tools-fastboot
Description: Cross-platform GUI for adb and fastboot
 FlashPack is a Qt6 front end for the official adb and fastboot tools.
 Flash partitions, read bootloader variables and reboot between modes.
